---
/** Portal — one account's plan. The Autopilot switch is real; the
    Intelligence line can be requested. */
---
<div class="mk-panel">
  <div class="mk-head"><b>Meridian Travel Co.</b><small>Autopilot plan</small></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Portal</b><small>CRM, magic links, inquiry form, proposals</small></div><span class="mk-fine">Included</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Autopilot</b><small>Nine stages, human touchpoints designed in</small></div><button type="button" class="mk-tog" role="switch" aria-checked="true" aria-label="Autopilot" data-live="toggle" data-on-text="Nine stages, human touchpoints designed in" data-off-text="Off — you move every stage by hand" data-off-amber="true"></button></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk wait"></span><div><b>Intelligence</b><small>Atlas and Vault, on your own data</small></div><button type="button" class="mk-btn o" data-live="set" data-done="Requested" data-small="Custom pricing · we'll be in touch">Request</button></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Horizon</b><small>Vetted suppliers, 130+ countries</small></div><span class="mk-fine">Included</span></div>
</div>
